{
  "_readme": "Curated OFFICIAL sources for the daily draft generator (api/cron-alerts.js → api/_queue.js). type 'rss' = RSS/Atom feed (works with no AI key: items become raw drafts). type 'page' = a normal web page; it is only read when OPENAI_API_KEY is set (AI picks out open calls and must use links that appear on the page). 'keywords' filters feed items by title/summary (any match). 'maxAgeDays' ignores older feed items. 'cat' is the default category. Set 'enabled': false to pause a source. Add only official sites (governments, universities, foundations, UN/IMF/World Bank) — never blogs or aggregators. 'checked' is the date the URL was last confirmed to load; re-check any source that shows an error in the admin 'Fetch drafts now' result.",
  "maxDraftsPerRun": 8,
